# Visual language

- Background: `#0a0a0a` (`void`). Accent: `#39ff14` (`neon`).
- Fonts: Inter (UI), JetBrains Mono (kicker, terminal, labels).
- Thin borders, small glow on CTAs. No purple SaaS gradients, no emoji-heavy marketing.
- Keep the fake terminal and fleet widget; they explain the product faster than extra paragraphs.
